          "text": "Description: A witness reports an observation made on Wednesday, November 18, 2009 at 7:01 AM. He witnessed the movement of an orange light. The movement speed varied with accelerations and decelerations on an irregular trajectory. The description of a dim orange light moving in a zigzag pattern at a low altitude, with changes in direction and speed \"with the wind,\" inevitably suggests the observation of a Thai-style kite. The case is classified as B: probable observation of a kite.",
